        "ver": "0.33.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description:\n\n[Shot 1]\nReference image guidance: Take the provided beauty portrait as the definitive character prototype. Precisely match the facial structure, eye shape, brow shape, lip fullness, hair quality, makeup texture and soft gentle temperament of the young East Asian woman in the reference image.\nWarm golden-hour beauty portrait of the referenced young East Asian woman in her early twenties, natural glowing makeup, glossy lips, loose long dark hair, soft cream knit top. Camera: front-facing close-up, eye-level, 85mm f/1.4 look, shallow depth of field, creamy circular bokeh, very slow gentle push-in, slight handheld breathing. She looks directly toward the camera, eyes catching warm specular highlights, breathing softly, giving a subtle relaxed smile. The low sun sits behind her head, creating a strong rim light on loose hair strands that glow like golden filaments. Warm peach and amber grade, real skin texture and pores, gentle highlight roll-off on cheekbones, soft lens flare and haze across the frame.\n\n[Shot 2]\nSame referenced young East Asian woman, same golden-hour meadow, same soft cream knit top and loose long dark hair. Camera: medium close-up tracking shot, closer framing, following her as she runs forward through the tall backlit grass. Core action: her body maintains a natural forward running rhythm, then she turns her head back to glance straight at the camera mid-stride, with a soft faint smile. The low sun remains behind her, outlining her flowing hair and shoulders in clean golden rim light, with soft natural fill light falling on her turned face, no harsh or abnormal light spots. Her long dark hair flows in the wind, every strand edged with backlight glow. Tall grass sways around her, dust motes glowing in the sunlight, blurred greenery and warm circular bokeh in the background. Smooth cinematic tracking movement, shallow depth of field, warm peach and amber grade, soft haze, consistent golden-hour atmosphere.\n\nShe gradually slows down and stops in the tall grass, her body still turned partly away from the camera, while she keeps looking back over her shoulder. The movement is gentle and natural: footsteps fade, body settles, hair and clothing slowly stop swaying from the run. She holds the backward glance for a quiet beat, then her soft smile deepens slightly. The low sun remains behind her, wrapping the edges of her hair and shoulders in bright golden rim light, while her face is lit by warm soft fill light. Tall grass sways around her, dust motes glowing in the sunlight, shallow depth of field, creamy circular bokeh, warm peach and amber grade, soft lens flare and haze.\n\nTransition: Shot 1 blends into Shot 2 through a soft golden lens flare and gentle camera drift, smoothly shifting from static intimate portrait to dynamic running glance. \n\noverall_soundscape:\nA soft warm breeze moves through the grass, distant birds, a faint rustle of clothing and grass, light footsteps, natural breath sounds during the run, no speech or intelligible dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nWarm lo-fi R&B, muted plucked guitar and soft brushed percussion at a relaxed tempo, low in the mix.\n\n脸部要与参考图片保持一致，人物保持一致\n\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
