        "text": "## Model files\n\n**LynnReal (this release)**\n\n- `lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n\n**MiniMax H3 components** (from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3))\n\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n- `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n- `minimaxh3_art_is_explosion.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/embeddings/`\n  (the prompt references it as `embedding:minimaxh3_art_is_explosion`)\n"
